# A negated pattern for a file cannot re-include it while an ANCESTOR
# directory is still excluded (gitignore(5)) -- `test/*` above excludes the
# `test/protocol` directory itself, so re-including it, re-excluding its
# contents, then re-including only these two files is the only way to pull
# just them in without also pulling in every other untracked file already
# sitting in test/protocol/ for unrelated reasons.
!test/protocol/
test/protocol/*
!test/protocol/conversation-mls-ds-signing.test.ts
!test/protocol/webvh-resolve-mimi-provider.test.ts
!test/protocol/didcomm-group-chat.test.ts
!test/protocol/didcomm-group-chat-store.test.ts

